   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thank you for developing a nice tool!</div><div><br></div>I have a Whole genome bisulfite sequence file that was mapped with bsmap-2.73.  I did not separate the CpG from CHG or CHH.<div>The input file for MethylKit looks like this.</div><div><br></div><div><div>chr<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>pos<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>strand<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>context<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ratio<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>C_count<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CT_count<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CI_lower<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CI_upper</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10005<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ACCCT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.053<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>19<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.009<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.246</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10016<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AACCC<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.038<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>26<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.007<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.189</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10018<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CCCTA<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.037<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>27<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.007<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.183</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10023<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ACCCT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.036<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>28<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.006<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.177</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10024<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CCCTA<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.071<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>28<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.020<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.226</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10035<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ACCCT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.036<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>28<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.006<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.177</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10046<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AACCC<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.034<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>29<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.006<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.172</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10048<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>CCCTA<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.033<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>30<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.006<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.167</div><div>chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10053<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ACCCT<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.067<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>30<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.018<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>0.213</div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div>1. when I plot the % methylation I get a plot that looks like below. </div><div>Is there something wrong with my data?  </div><div>2. when I examine the output of methylRaw object it shows a column with coverage numCs numTs.</div><div>For example the second line from input is shown as </div><div>    chr start end strand coverage numCs numTs</div><div> 1  10016    +   +   +      0.038        0          0 </div><div>Why is numCs and numTs zero?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you.</div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-39dqZKc42-A/Uz8WkEwbODI/AAAAAAAAABA/Dfhf6Ofu5rQ/s1600/Screen+Shot+2014-04-04+at+4.06.38+AM.png\" style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em;line-height:18px;text-align:center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-39dqZKc42-A/Uz8WkEwbODI/AAAAAAAAABA/Dfhf6Ofu5rQ/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2014-04-04%2Bat%2B4.06.38%2BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234576201000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dl6p_Mmy3JT73wgtn-4P2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-39dqZKc42-A/Uz8WkEwbODI/AAAAAAAAABA/Dfhf6Ofu5rQ/s1600/Screen+Shot+2014-04-04+at+4.06.38+AM.png\" border=\"0\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
